103 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (Several directions could extend the project further. The most natural next step would be expanding the 3D treatment beyond Everest to other major Himalayan peaks, allowing users to explore expedition routes across the full range rather than a single mountain. The transition between the Himalayas atlas and The Conquest could also be reworked; a more native visual handoff between the two sections would make the geographic context feel less like a separate plate and more like a continuous journey into the mountain. Finally, the site is not currently optimised for mobile, and given the scrollytelling architecture and the 3D scenes, making it work well on smaller screens would require a meaningful redesign of several sections rather than simple resizing.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
